---
name: quality-report
version: 1.1.0
description: Final QA closeout report template for PASS verdicts.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - qa_pass
  - sprint_id
  - task_id
  - branch
  - commit
  - pr_number
  - verdict
  - validated_scope_md
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - residual_risks_md
  - merge_readiness
  - merge_reason
  - recommendation
  - execution_inventory
  - execution_required
optional_variables:
  - blocking_ids_json
defaults:
  blocking_ids_json: "[]"
metadata:
  type: qa-quality-report
  tags:
    - stage:qa
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint_id
    state: qa-approved
    stage: qa
    transition: approved
    iteration_variable: qa_pass
---
{% for i in execution_inventory %}{% if execution_inventory | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", i.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", i.id) | list | length != 1 %}{{ i.id | execution_inventory_duplicate_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} is listed twice in the reviewer inventory
{% endif %}{% set m = execution_required | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", i.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", i.id) | selectattr("ref", "eq", i.ref) | list %}{% if m | length != 1 %}{{ i.id | execution_required_omitted_or_duplicate_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} needs exactly one resolution
{% else %}{% for x in m %}{% if x.status != "pass" or x.evidence_commit != commit %}{{ i.id | execution_required_unresolved_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} is not resolved at {{ commit }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% for r in execution_required %}{% if execution_inventory | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", r.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", r.id) | selectattr("ref", "eq", r.ref) | list | length != 1 %}{{ r.id | execution_required_unmatched_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: resolution {{ r.id }} matches no reviewer execution-required entry
{% endif %}{% endfor %}# Final Quality Report

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
QA Pass: {{ qa_pass }}
Sprint/Task: {{ sprint_id }} / {{ task_id }}
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: #{{ pr_number }}
Final Verdict: **{{ verdict }}**

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "sprint": "{{ sprint_id }}",
  "task": "{{ task_id }}",
  "branch": "{{ branch }}",
  "commit": "{{ commit }}",
  "pr": {{ pr_number }},
  "verdict": "{{ verdict }}",
  "findings": {
    "blocking": {{ findings_blocking }},
    "important": {{ findings_important }},
    "minor": {{ findings_minor }}
  },
  "blocking_ids": {{ blocking_ids_json }},
  "merge_readiness": "{{ merge_readiness }}",
  "merge_reason": "{{ merge_reason }}",
  "next_action": "none",
  "owner": "none",
  "recommendation": "{{ recommendation }}",
  "execution_inventory": {{ execution_inventory | tojson }},
  "execution_required": {{ execution_required | tojson }}
}
```
{% if execution_required %}
## Execution-Required Items
| id | reviewer | ref | command | expected | result | evidence commit | status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for item in execution_required %}| {{ item.id }} | {{ item.reviewer }} | {{ item.ref }} | `{{ item.command }}` | {{ item.expected }} | {{ item.result }} | `{{ item.evidence_commit }}` | {{ item.status }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

## Validated Scope
{% if validated_scope_md -%}
{{ validated_scope_md }}
{% else -%}
- not specified
{% endif %}

## Findings Summary (Final)
- Blocking: {{ findings_blocking }}
- Important: {{ findings_important }}
- Minor: {{ findings_minor }}

## Residual Risks
{% if residual_risks_md -%}
{{ residual_risks_md }}
{% else -%}
- none
{% endif %}

## Merge Readiness
- Status: **{{ merge_readiness }}**
- Reason: {{ merge_reason }}

## Recommendation
{{ recommendation }}
